    "Anahtar buluta y\u00fcklenmez; di\u011fer cihazlarda tekrar girmen gerekir.": "Token tidak pernah dimuat naik ke awan; masukkan semula pada peranti lain.", // EN: The token is never uploaded to the cloud; re-enter it on other devices.
