    "Sessiz saatlerde d\u0131\u015fa d\u00f6n\u00fck kanallar durur; uyar\u0131lar uygulama i\u00e7inde birikmeye devam eder.": "Semasa waktu senyap, saluran keluar berhenti; amaran terus terkumpul di dalam aplikasi.", // EN: During quiet hours outbound channels pause; alerts keep accumulating inside the app.
    "Kritik uyar\u0131lar sessiz saatleri a\u015fs\u0131n": "Benarkan amaran kritikal melepasi waktu senyap", // EN: Let critical alerts bypass quiet hours
    "G\u00fcvenlik, acil durum ve alarm olaylar\u0131 bu saatlerde de bildirilir.": "Keselamatan, kecemasan dan acara penggera masih dihantar semasa waktu tersebut.", // EN: Security, emergency and alarm events are still delivered during those hours.
    "Ses ve Titre\u015fim": "Bunyi dan Getaran", // EN: Sound and Vibration
    "Kritik uyar\u0131lar her zaman sesli gelir. Titre\u015fim yaln\u0131zca telefonda ge\u00e7erlidir; Android'de ses ve titre\u015fim ayr\u0131ca telefonun bildirim ayarlar\u0131ndan da de\u011fi\u015ftirilebilir.": "Amaran kritikal sentiasa berbunyi. Getaran hanya digunakan pada telefon; pada Android, bunyi dan getaran juga boleh diubah dalam tetapan notifikasi sistem.", // EN: Critical alerts always sound. Vibration applies on phones only; on Android, sound and vibration can also be changed in the system notification settings.
    "Bilgisayar a\u00e7\u0131l\u0131nca ba\u015flat": "Mulakan dengan komputer", // EN: Start with computer
    "Bilgisayar a\u00e7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda NEXUS arka planda a\u00e7\u0131ls\u0131n.": "Lancarkan NEXUS di latar belakang apabila komputer anda dimulakan.", // EN: Launch NEXUS in the background when your computer starts.
