    "Pencere kapat\u0131lsa da otomasyonlar tepside \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmaya devam etsin.": "Automasi terus berjalan di dulang sistem apabila tetingkap ditutup.", // EN: Automations keep running in system tray when the window is closed.
