    "Hava durumu tetikleyicisi: ev konumu se\u00e7ilmedi.": "Pencetus cuaca: tiada lokasi rumah ditetapkan.", // EN: Weather trigger: no home location set.
    "Tetiklenince \u00c7al\u0131\u015facak Senaryo": "Senario untuk Dijalankan Apabila Dicetuskan", // EN: Scenario to Run When Triggered
    "Yaln\u0131zca bildirim": "Notifikasi sahaja", // EN: Notification only
    "Zamanlamal\u0131 otomasyonlar uygulama a\u00e7\u0131kken \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r; masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131 tepsideyken de zamanlamalar devam eder.": "Automasi berjadual berjalan semasa aplikasi dibuka; di desktop, ia terus berjalan selagi aplikasi berada dalam dulang sistem.", // EN: Scheduled automations run while the app is open; on desktop they keep running while the app stays in the tray.
    "Otomasyonlar uygulama a\u00e7\u0131kken \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r; masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131 tepsideyken de zamanlamalar devam eder.": "Automasi berjalan semasa aplikasi dibuka; di desktop, jadual terus berjalan selagi aplikasi berada dalam dulang sistem.", // EN: Automations run while the app is open; on desktop, schedules continue while the app stays in the tray.
