    "Haz\u0131r olanlar \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r durumda; haz\u0131r olmayanlar \"Yak\u0131nda\" olarak i\u015faretlidir.": "Item sedia ada berfungsi sekarang; item yang belum sedia ditandakan \"Akan datang\".", // EN: Ready items work now; items that are not ready are marked "Coming soon".
    "Apple Watch Deste\u011fi Yak\u0131nda": "Sokongan Apple Watch Akan Datang", // EN: Apple Watch Support Coming Soon
    "NEXUS hen\u00fcz Apple Watch uygulamas\u0131 i\u00e7ermiyor. Yay\u0131nland\u0131\u011f\u0131nda bile\u011finden senaryolar\u0131 \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131p kritik uyar\u0131lar\u0131 g\u00f6rebileceksin.": "NEXUS belum termasuk aplikasi Apple Watch. Setelah dikeluarkan, anda akan dapat menjalankan senario dan melihat amaran kritikal dari pergelangan tangan anda.", // EN: NEXUS does not include an Apple Watch app yet. Once released, you will be able to run scenarios and see critical alerts from your wrist.
    "Bug\u00fcn Ne Yapabilirsin": "Apa Yang Boleh Anda Lakukan Hari Ini", // EN: What You Can Do Today
    "Kritik olaylar i\u00e7in bildirimleri a\u00e7\u0131k tut; uyar\u0131lar\u0131 telefonunda hemen g\u00f6r\u00fcrs\u00fcn.": "Pastikan notifikasi dihidupkan untuk acara kritikal; anda akan melihat amaran di telefon anda dengan segera.", // EN: Keep notifications on for critical events; you see alerts on your phone right away.
    "Saatinde bu bildirimlerin g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcp g\u00f6r\u00fcnmeyece\u011fi iPhone'unun Watch ayarlar\u0131na ba\u011fl\u0131d\u0131r; NEXUS saate \u00f6zel bir \u015fey g\u00f6ndermez.": "Sama ada notifikasi ini dipaparkan di jam anda bergantung pada tetapan Watch iPhone anda; NEXUS tidak menghantar apa-apa yang khusus ke jam.", // EN: Whether these notifications show on your watch depends on your iPhone's Watch settings; NEXUS sends nothing specific to the watch.
    "Bildirim Ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 A\u00e7": "Buka Tetapan Notifikasi", // EN: Open Notification Settings
    "Anahtar\u0131 kopyala": "Salin kunci", // EN: Copy key
    "Kimlik uygulamas\u0131nda a\u00e7": "Buka dalam aplikasi pengesah", // EN: Open in authenticator app
    "Kimlik uygulamas\u0131na eri\u015fimini kaybedersen giri\u015fte kod istenece\u011fi i\u00e7in hesab\u0131na giremezsin. Bu anahtar\u0131 g\u00fcvenli bir yere kaydet.": "Jika anda kehilangan akses ke aplikasi pengesah anda, anda tidak akan dapat log masuk, kerana kod diperlukan semasa log masuk. Simpan kunci ini di tempat yang selamat.", // EN: If you lose access to your authenticator app you won't be able to sign in, because a code is required at login. Save this key somewhere safe.
