    "Hesab\u0131n, profilin ve senkronize verilerin kal\u0131c\u0131 olarak silinir. Aktif NEXUS+ aboneli\u011fin varsa \u00f6nce Faturaland\u0131rma'dan iptal et. Bu i\u015flem geri al\u0131namaz.": "Akaun, profil dan data yang diselaraskan anda telah dipadam secara kekal. Jika anda mempunyai langganan NEXUS+ yang aktif, batalkan dari Penagihan terlebih dahulu. Ini tidak boleh dipulihkan.", // EN: Your account, profile and synced data are permanently deleted. If you have an active NEXUS+ subscription, cancel it from Billing first. This cannot be undone.
    "Emin misin? Tekrar dokunarak sil": "Adakah anda pasti? Ketik semula untuk memadam", // EN: Are you sure? Tap again to delete
    "Siliniyor\u2026": "Sedang memadam\u2026", // EN: Deleting…
    "Hesap silindi. Aboneli\u011fini Whop hesab\u0131ndan iptal etmeyi unutma.": "Akaun dipadam. Ingat untuk membatalkan langganan anda dari akaun Whop anda.", // EN: Account deleted. Remember to cancel your subscription from your Whop account.
    "Hesab\u0131n ve verilerin silindi.": "Akaun dan data anda telah dipadam.", // EN: Your account and data were deleted.
    "Bu cihazdaki NEXUS verilerini silmek i\u00e7in Ayarlar \u2192 \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f Yap yeterli; bulut hesab\u0131 yok.": "Untuk membuang data NEXUS pada peranti ini, Tetapan \u2192 Log keluar sudah memadai; tiada akaun awan.", // EN: To remove NEXUS data on this device, Settings → Sign out is enough; there is no cloud account.
    "Hesap silme fonksiyonu hen\u00fcz da\u011f\u0131t\u0131lmad\u0131. \u015eimdilik \u00e7\u0131k\u0131\u015f yapabilirsin.": "Pemadaman akaun di pihak pelayan belum dilaksanakan. Anda boleh log keluar untuk sementara waktu.", // EN: The server-side account deletion isn't deployed yet. You can sign out for now.
    "! Rahats\u0131z etme modunu a\u00e7t\u0131m, hi\u00e7bir bildirim seni rahats\u0131z etmeyecek. [ACTION: ENABLE_DND]": "! Saya telah menghidupkan Jangan Ganggu; tiada notifikasi akan mengganggu anda. [TINDAKAN: DAYA_TAHAN_DND]", // EN: ! I turned on Do Not Disturb; no notifications will bother you. [ACTION: ENABLE_DND]
    "\" senaryosunu \u015fimdilik ana ekrandaki T\u0131kla ve \u00c7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r kart\u0131ndan tek dokunu\u015fla \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131rabilirsin. NEXUS App Store'da yay\u0131nland\u0131\u011f\u0131nda bu ekrandan do\u011frudan Siri'ye ekleyebileceksin.": "\"Senario\" boleh dijalankan dengan satu ketikan dari kad 'Ketuk untuk Jalankan' di skrin utama buat masa ini. Setelah NEXUS tersedia di App Store, anda akan dapat menambahkannya ke Siri terus dari skrin ini.", // EN: " scenario can be run with one tap from the Tap to Run card on the home screen for now. Once NEXUS is on the App Store, you'll be able to add it to Siri directly from this screen.
    "\" ve t\u00fcm ayarlar\u0131 kal\u0131c\u0131 olarak silinecek. Emin misin?": "Dan semua tetapan akan dipadam secara kekal. Adakah anda pasti?", // EN: " and all its settings will be deleted permanently. Are you sure?
