    "Bu ayki tasarruf": "Disimpan bulan ini", // EN: Saved this month
    "Bu a\u011fda desteklenen bir cihaz bulunamad\u0131.": "Tiada peranti yang disokong ditemui di rangkaian ini.", // EN: No supported device was found on this network.
    "Bu a\u011fda desteklenen bir cihaz bulunamad\u0131. Cihaz\u0131n a\u00e7\u0131k ve ayn\u0131 Wi-Fi'da oldu\u011fundan emin ol; olmazsa a\u015fa\u011f\u0131dan katalo\u011fu ya da QR / kurulum kodunu kullan.": "Tiada peranti yang disokong ditemui dalam rangkaian ini. Pastikan peranti dihidupkan dan disambungkan ke Wi-Fi yang sama; jika tidak, gunakan katalog di bawah atau kod QR / pemasangan.", // EN: No supported device was found on this network. Make sure the device is on and connected to the same Wi-Fi; otherwise use the catalog below or a QR / setup code.
