    "Cihaz\u0131n IP adresini yaz, NEXUS konu\u015fabildi\u011fi protokol\u00fc kendisi anlas\u0131n.": "Taipkan alamat IP peranti dan NEXUS menentukan protokol yang digunakannya.", // EN: Type the device's IP address and NEXUS figures out which protocol it speaks.
    "Cihaz\u0131n Wi-Fi ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 ve modemini kontrol et. Sorun s\u00fcrerse cihaz\u0131 kald\u0131r\u0131p yeniden ekle. Ad\u0131mlar: Cihazlar > cihaz\u0131 se\u00e7 > Kald\u0131r.": "Periksa sambungan Wi-Fi peranti dan penghala anda. Jika masalah berterusan, alih keluar peranti dan tambah semula. Langkah-langkah: Peranti > pilih peranti > Alih keluar.", // EN: Check the device's Wi-Fi connection and your router. If the problem continues, remove the device and add it again. Steps: Devices > choose the device > Remove.
    "Cihaz\u0131n Wi-Fi ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 ve modeminizi kontrol edin. Sorun s\u00fcrerse cihaz\u0131 NEXUS uygulamas\u0131ndan kald\u0131r\u0131p yeniden ekleyin.": "Periksa sambungan Wi-Fi peranti dan penghala anda. Jika masalah berterusan, keluarkan peranti dari aplikasi NEXUS dan tambah semula.", // EN: Check the device's Wi-Fi connection and your router. If the problem continues, remove the device from the NEXUS app and add it again.
    "Cihaz\u0131n g\u00f6r\u00fcnm\u00fcyorsa QR tarama veya kurulum kodu yolunu kullan. Destek ve y\u00f6nlendirme i\u00e7in yard\u0131m sayfas\u0131n\u0131 a\u00e7abilirsin.": "Jika peranti anda tidak muncul, gunakan imbasan QR atau kod persediaan. Anda boleh membuka halaman bantuan untuk sokongan dan panduan.", // EN: If your device doesn't show up, use QR scanning or a setup code. You can open the help page for support and guidance.
    "Cihaz\u0131n konum (GPS) servisi kapal\u0131. A\u00e7\u0131p tekrar dene.": "Perkhidmatan lokasi (GPS) peranti anda dimatikan. Hidupkan dan cuba semula.", // EN: Your device's location (GPS) service is off. Turn it on and try again.
    "Cihaz\u0131n konum servisini desteklemiyor.": "Peranti anda tidak menyokong perkhidmatan lokasi.", // EN: Your device doesn't support location services.
