    "K\u00f6pr\u00fcye ba\u011flan\u0131lamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan emin ol ve tekrar dene.": "Tidak dapat menyambung ke jambatan. Pastikan anda berada pada rangkaian yang sama dan cuba lagi.", // EN: Couldn't connect to the bridge. Make sure you're on the same network and try again.
