    "Misafir a\u011f\u0131 veya ge\u00e7ici eri\u015fim bilgisi olmadan haz\u0131r durum g\u00f6stermiyoruz.": "Kami tidak menunjukkan keadaan sedia tanpa rangkaian tetamu atau butiran akses sementara.", // EN: We don't show a ready state without guest network or temporary access details.
    "Misafir geldi\u011fi anda giri\u015f, ayd\u0131nlatma ve ortak alan cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 haz\u0131rlayan bir misafir modu uygulamas\u0131 olu\u015ftur. Kar\u015f\u0131lama \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131, sessiz bildirim ve misafir eri\u015fim ad\u0131mlar\u0131 olsun.": "Cipta aplikasi mod tetamu yang menyediakan pintu masuk, pencahayaan dan peranti kawasan bersama sebaik sahaja tetamu tiba. Sertakan lampu selamat datang, notifikasi senyap dan langkah akses tetamu.", // EN: Create a guest mode app that prepares the entrance, lighting and shared-area devices as soon as guests arrive. Include a welcome light, quiet notifications and guest access steps.
    "Misafir geldi\u011fi anda kullan\u0131lacak \u0131\u015f\u0131k, eri\u015fim ve ortam ayarlar\u0131.": "Tetapan cahaya, akses dan suasana untuk digunakan sebaik sahaja tetamu tiba.", // EN: Light, access and ambience settings to use as soon as guests arrive.
    "Misafir gelmeden \u00f6nce giri\u015f, ayd\u0131nlatma, ortak alan ve e\u011flence cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 tek panelde haz\u0131rla. Ev i\u00e7inde rahat ama g\u00fcvenli bir kar\u015f\u0131lama ak\u0131\u015f\u0131 olu\u015ftur.": "Sediakan pintu masuk, pencahayaan, kawasan bersama dan peranti hiburan pada satu panel sebelum tetamu tiba. Cipta aliran selamat datang yang santai tetapi selamat di rumah.", // EN: Prepare the entrance, lighting, shared areas and entertainment devices on one panel before guests arrive. Create a relaxed but secure welcome flow at home.
