    "Bu adreste bir cihaz var ama NEXUS protokol\u00fc konu\u015fmuyor.": "Terdapat peranti di alamat ini, tetapi ia tidak menggunakan protokol NEXUS.", // EN: There is a device at this address, but it does not speak a NEXUS protocol.
    "Bu cihaz zaten ekli.": "Peranti ini sudah ditambah.", // EN: This device is already added.
    "E\u015fle\u015ftir ve ekle": "Padankan dan tambah", // EN: Pair and add
    "E\u015fle\u015ftirme kodu ge\u00e7ersiz. 11 haneli kodu ya da MT: ile ba\u015flayan QR i\u00e7eri\u011fini gir.": "Kod pemadanan tidak sah. Masukkan kod 11 digit atau kandungan QR yang bermula dengan MT:", // EN: The pairing code is not valid. Enter the 11-digit code or the QR content that starts with MT:.
    "Bu kodu NEXUS masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131nda gir. Cihaz Wi-Fi ile ba\u011fl\u0131ysa yerel a\u011fdan IP adresiyle de ekleyebilirsin.": "Masukkan kod ini dalam aplikasi desktop NEXUS. Jika peranti menggunakan Wi-Fi, anda juga boleh menambahnya dari rangkaian tempatan anda melalui alamat IPnya.", // EN: Enter this code in the NEXUS desktop app. If the device is on Wi-Fi, you can also add it from your local network by its IP address.
    "Cihaz ayn\u0131 a\u011fda aran\u0131yor ve e\u015fle\u015ftiriliyor. Bu bir dakikay\u0131 bulabilir; cihaz\u0131n a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda olmas\u0131 gerekir.": "Peranti sedang dicari dalam rangkaian yang sama dan sedang dipasangkan. Ini mungkin mengambil masa sehingga satu minit; peranti mesti dihidupkan dan dalam mod pasangan.", // EN: The device is being searched for on the same network and paired. This can take up to a minute; the device must be on and in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz bulunamad\u0131 ya da e\u015fle\u015ftirilemedi. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda, a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Peranti tidak ditemui atau tidak dapat dipasangkan. Pastikan ia berada dalam rangkaian yang sama, dihidupkan dan dalam mod pasangan.", // EN: The device was not found or could not be paired. Make sure it is on the same network, powered on and in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz bulunamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda, a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011fundan emin ol. Bilgisayar\u0131n g\u00fcvenlik duvar\u0131 yerel a\u011fdaki cihazlar\u0131n yan\u0131t\u0131n\u0131 engelliyor olabilir.": "Peranti tidak ditemui. Pastikan ia berada dalam rangkaian yang sama, dihidupkan dan dalam mod pasangan. Firewall komputer anda mungkin menghalang balasan daripada peranti dalam rangkaian tempatan.", // EN: The device was not found. Make sure it is on the same network, powered on and in pairing mode. Your computer's firewall may be blocking replies from devices on the local network.
    "Cihaz e\u015fle\u015ftirilemedi. E\u015fle\u015ftirme kodunu ve cihaz\u0131n e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011funu kontrol et.": "Peranti tidak dapat dipasangkan. Semak kod pasangan dan pastikan peranti dalam mod pasangan.", // EN: The device could not be paired. Check the pairing code and that the device is in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz e\u015fle\u015fti ama NEXUS'un kontrol edebilece\u011fi bir i\u015flevi yok.": "Peranti telah dipadankan tetapi tiada fungsi yang boleh dikawal oleh NEXUS.", // EN: The device paired but has no function NEXUS can control.
    "Cihaz yan\u0131t vermedi. A\u00e7\u0131k ve ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Peranti tidak memberi respons. Pastikan ia dihidupkan dan berada dalam rangkaian yang sama.", // EN: The device did not respond. Make sure it is on and on the same network.
