    "Broker'\u0131n (\u00f6r. Mosquitto) yerel IP adresini yaz. Kullan\u0131c\u0131 ad\u0131 ve parola yaln\u0131zca bu cihazda saklan\u0131r. \u015eimdilik lamba ve prizlerde a\u00e7/kapat ve parlakl\u0131k desteklenir.": "Tambah peranti Zigbee2MQTT (broker MQTT)", // EN: Enter the local IP address of the broker (e.g. Mosquitto). The username and password are stored only on this device. On/off and brightness for lights and plugs are supported for now.
